
create tasks by sending a POST request to the /jobs/ endpoint with a JSON body containing the task details.

curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/jobs/ \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"task":"Generate Monthly Report"}'


get job details by sending a GET request to the /jobs/{job_id}/ endpoint.

curl --location --request GET 'http://localhost:3000/jobs/6'